#: ../../source/docs/install-windows.rst:33 12b1bb109ce84281929062ac4c6b5a5e
msgid "Run .exe file"
msgstr "运行 .exe 文件"

#: ../../source/docs/install-windows.rst:35 141b0aed34ad402ba8849ae5dbaca8e3
msgid ""
"Open the .exe file to run the installation wizard. Read the open-source "
"license agreement, and select Accept. Select a destination folder for the "
"installation (the default option is fine if you aren't sure)."
msgstr "打开 .exe 文件以运行安装向导。阅读开源许可协议并选择「Accept」。选择安装目标文件夹（如果不确定，使用默认选项即可）。"

#: ../../source/docs/install-windows.rst:46 62a0896a976c434b8dd6c99459e4200c
msgid "Select options"
msgstr "选择选项"

#: ../../source/docs/install-windows.rst:48 d0c5ff8d596246199657165b79d593b7
msgid ""
"Choose your installation options. Select **APM Planner 2 files** and **Qt "
"components**. Select **Create Start Menu Shortcuts** to make APM Planner "
"easy to access from the start menu. Select **Install**."
msgstr ""
"选择安装选项。勾选「APM Planner 2 files」和「Qt components」。选择「Create Start Menu "
"Shortcuts」以便从开始菜单快速访问 APM Planner。选择「Install」。"

#: ../../source/docs/install-windows.rst:56 9561d10700254dd4a5a2818dac19d128
msgid "Close wizard to complete installation"
msgstr "关闭向导完成安装"

#: ../../source/docs/install-windows.rst:58 c790514cdd074a9b9bb025005c474b6b
msgid ""
"Select **Close** to exist the wizard. Your installation is now complete. "
"Open APM Planner to run the application."
msgstr "选择「Close」退出向导。安装现已完成。打开 APM Planner 以运行应用程序。"
